From a2175b3b06d4b523673bca7d00bcc05629e3245a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:17:07 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 65/65] ASoC: mediatek: mt8186: Add MT6789 PCM2 MD1 voice call
 crossbar

Expose MediaTek MT6789's internal MD1 voice PCM2 interface (PCM2_INTF_CON
at 0x053c, AFE_CONN17/18 uplink crossbar, and PCM_2_CAP_CH1 mono-to-stereo
downlink onto ADDA_DL_CH1/CH2) along with the Hostless_Speech DPCM
front-end
DAI link in mt6789-mt6366.

Together with /dev/ccci_aud speech mailbox control, this enables
zero-CPU-DMA hardware routing between MT6366 analog earpiece/speaker/
headset/mic and MD1 for cellular voice calls at 8/16/32/48 kHz.

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <sysretq0@proton.me>

